sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as Browser
    participant P1 as Public edge
    participant P2 as BFF replica
    participant P3 as Redis
    participant P4 as Identity Provider
    P0->>P1: GET login
    P1->>P2: Route login
    P2->>P3: Save state
    P2-->>P0: 302 to provider
    P0->>P4: Login and MFA
    P4-->>P0: 302 callback with code
    P0->>P1: GET callback
    P1->>P2: Route code
    P2->>P3: Check state
    P2->>P4: Code and verifier
    P4-->>P2: Tokens
    P2->>P3: Save session
    P2-->>P0: Cookie and 302 UI
